+- Current dated boundary: [three-dimensional counterexample preprint](https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.00222), [HC4 $\Rightarrow$ JC2](https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.22198), [quartic HC4 preprint](https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.14217).

